	(text "Drives G of both PWM AM26LV31E of the port (G~ tied high) and DE of its EN driver. With +24V_GD off\n(CHB_OK low), the port disabled, or that board's driver supplies not good (RDY low: its eFuse tripped or\nits bias failed) every pair of the port is high impedance, so the drivers no longer back-power an\nunpowered board: <= 16 x 100 uA (AM26LV31E IOZ, SLLS848C) + 2 x 125 uA (THVD1450 bus input) = 1.85 mA\nworst case per board instead of ~32 mA, inside every input-current rating; its fail-safe receivers read\nPWM and EN low, and an unpowered board has no gate bias. RDY_F = the filtered RDY (cell sheets)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 209.18 91.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "32c07687-89f7-517a-ab7a-c2c2633ab1d2")
	)
	(text "HARDWARE GATE-ENABLE AND (BOTH SAFETY CHANNELS)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5922ce7b-6aa8-534f-b367-5be47beaf67c")
	)
	(text "THVD1450 per port: D = Cn_EN, DE = Cn_DRV_EN, A/B = EN_P/EN_N, |VOD| >= 2 V into 100 R (SLLSEY3E 7.7).\nReceiver always on (RE~ low): R = the pair's state at the CTRL end -> Cn_EN_RB on a spare GPIO, so a\nstuck AND gate or driver is visible (INT-22; start-up and proof-test sequence in the pin plan)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 162.044 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "760c2a80-1d42-5ffb-a7cc-a40c79116124")
	)
	(text "EN LINE DRIVERS WITH READBACK (C1-C4)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 119.224 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7fcb4f85-99db-5749-8d90-2962b93b3e17")
	)
	(text "FLT RECEIVERS (C1-C4), FAIL-SAFE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 174.544 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ac197c1e-2bf4-5bf3-a1a8-815aaff425b3")
	)
	(text "TEST POINTS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 194.032 174.544 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c75ca9f8-dc03-5318-82b5-aed0a54380e5")
	)
	(text "Pair wired swapped (A = FLT_N, B = FLT_P): Cn_FAULT is high = fault. 560R bias + 120R termination\nput +0.32 V across an open/unplugged pair (> VIT+ 0.2 V) -> fault; the AM26LV32E rev E only has\nopen-circuit (not terminated) fail-safe, hence the external bias. Healthy: driver -2 V -> low.\nCn_FAULT -> INPUTXBAR2-5 -> ePWM X-BAR -> TRIP4/5/7/8 (no firmware in the trip path)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 261.944 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "dd17578e-f937-531c-91f2-ffe8d726eb96")
	)
	(text "Gated EN (after the AND) and receiver FAULT outputs, one pair per port."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 194.032 204.468 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e7bbf01d-5471-570b-8976-56bafe4f2452")
	)
	(text "LINE-DRIVER ENABLE CN_DRV_EN = CHB_OK AND CN_EN_MCU AND CN_RDY (INT-15)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 209.18 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f241522c-704c-583e-9130-5602c4beb007")
	)
	(text "Cn_EN = GATE_EN (channel A) AND CHB_OK (channel B) AND Cn_EN_MCU, one 3-input gate per port:\nfirmware alone can never raise an EN pair. Channel B also removes +24V_GD (gate-driver bias) on SYS.\n10k pull-downs hold each MCU enable low in reset; GATE_EN and CHB_OK are pulled low on the SYS side.\nSpare gates: inputs to GND, outputs open."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 106.724 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "fecb9449-32e6-5f18-900f-ada4dfa3e5e6")
	)
